[80.871241, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ selectors parse key=value \u001b[90m(1.512543ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ resources group by branch tag \u001b[90m(0.231758ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ summary warns about untagged resources \u001b[90m(0.325279ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan includes untagged resources created by the branch's stack \u001b[90m(0.488347ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan deletes dependents before the resources they depend on \u001b[90m(0.231731ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ label keys are case-insensitive for grouping, selectors and branch planning \u001b[90m(0.487175ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ legacy tags take precedence over labels \u001b[90m(0.198811ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ label-owned resources still respect genuine external dependents \u001b[90m(0.205001ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ a label-owned resource can identify an untagged stack sibling \u001b[90m(0.315623ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ tests 11\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ suites 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ pass 11\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ fail 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ cancelled 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ skipped 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ todo 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ duration_ms 1408.773203\u001b[39m\r\n"]
